#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:1
msgid "Documentation decisions"
msgstr "Izinqumo zedokhumenti"

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:3
msgid ""
"I wrote these pages as a sample of how I document an API for developers. "
"This page explains the choices, so you can judge my thinking as well as "
"my writing."
msgstr ""
"Ngibhale la makhasi njengesibonelo sendlela engibhala ngayo amadokhumenti "
"e-API onjiniyela. Leli khasi lichaza izinqumo engizenzile, ukuze ukwazi "
"ukuhlola indlela engicabanga ngayo kanye nendlela engibhala ngayo."

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:5
msgid "Why the quickstart comes first"
msgstr "Kungani i-quickstart iza kuqala"

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:7
msgid ""
"Someone evaluating an API wants proof that it works before they read "
"anything else. The quickstart gets a real request running in a few "
"minutes, then explains every field in the response. Every other page "
"links back to it."
msgstr ""
"Umuntu ohlola i-API ufuna ubufakazi bokuthi iyasebenza ngaphambi kokuba "
"afunde okunye. I-quickstart yenza i-request yangempela isebenze ngemizuzu "
"embalwa, bese ichaza yonke i-field ekwi-response. Wonke amanye amakhasi "
"axhuma abuyele kuyo."

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:9
msgid "Why the examples are real files"
msgstr "Kungani izibonelo zingamafayela angempela"

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:11
msgid ""
"The code on these pages is pulled straight from the `examples` folder. I "
"ran each one against the running service: curl, Python and JavaScript. "
"The docs show exactly the code that ran, and there is no second copy to "
"go stale. Sample code that drifts away from the docs is one of the most "
"common ways developer documentation stops being trusted."
msgstr ""
"I-code ekula makhasi ithathwe ngqo kufolda ye-`examples`. Ngisebenzise "
"ngayinye ngokumelene ne-service esebenzayo: curl, Python kanye ne-JavaScript. "
"Amadokhumenti abonisa yona kanye i-code esebenze, futhi ayikho enye ikhophi "
"engaguga. I-sample code ehlukana namadokhumenti ingenye yezindlela ezivame "
"kakhulu ezenza amadokhumenti onjiniyela angasathembwa."

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:13
msgid "Why errors get their own page"
msgstr "Kungani ama-error enekhasi lawo"

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:15
msgid ""
"Errors are where developers spend most of their debugging time. Every "
"failure uses one shape, with a `type` to branch on, a `message` for "
"people and a `request_id` for support. The table says which errors are "
"worth retrying, because that is the question a developer actually has at "
"that moment."
msgstr ""
"Ama-error yilapho onjiniyela bechitha khona isikhathi esiningi be-debugging. "
"Konke ukwehluleka kusebenzisa isakhiwo esisodwa, esine-`type` yokunquma "
"indlela yokucubungula, i-`message` yabantu kanye ne-`request_id` ye-support. "
"Ithebula lichaza ukuthi yimaphi ama-error okufanele aphinde azanywe, ngoba "
"yilowo mbuzo unjiniyela aba nawo ngaleso sikhathi."

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:17
msgid "Why the reference is generated"
msgstr "Kungani i-reference ikhiqizwa"

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:19
msgid ""
"The API reference comes from `openapi/openapi.yaml`, and that file is "
"exported from the service code. The continuous integration check fails if"
" the file is out of date. I would rather explain the API in prose and let"
" a tool list the parameters, because copying parameters by hand is how "
"references end up wrong."
msgstr ""
"I-reference ye-API ivela ku-`openapi/openapi.yaml`, futhi lelo fayela "
"likhishwa ku-code ye-service. Ukuhlolwa kwe-continuous integration kuyehluleka "
"uma ifayela lingabuyekeziwe. Ngingathanda ukuchaza i-API ngamagama bese "
"ngivumela ithuluzi libhale ama-parameter, ngoba ukukopisha ama-parameter "
"ngesandla yikho okwenza ama-reference agcine enamaphutha."

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:21
msgid "Why the model is a stub"
msgstr "Kungani i-model iyi-stub"

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:23
msgid ""
"I do not have a real model, and inventing behaviour I cannot verify would"
" make these docs untrustworthy. The stub returns predictable text, so "
"every response on these pages is exactly what you get if you run the "
"request. The tokenizer is simple for the same reason, and the tokens page"
" says so plainly."
msgstr ""
"Anginayo i-model yangempela, futhi ukusungula indlela yokuziphatha engingakwazi "
"ukuyiqinisekisa kungenza la madokhumenti angathembeki. I-stub ibuyisa umbhalo "
"ongabikezelwa, ngakho yonke i-response kula makhasi iyona kanye oyitholayo "
"uma usebenzisa i-request. I-tokenizer ilula ngenxa yesizathu esifanayo, futhi "
"ikhasi lama-tokens likusho ngokusobala."

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:25
msgid "Why tokens and regions get attention"
msgstr "Kungani ama-token nama-region enikezwa ukunakwa"

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:27
msgid ""
"For developers building in African languages, two questions come up "
"early: how many tokens their text will use, and where their data is "
"processed. I added a token counting endpoint and a `region` parameter to "
"give those questions a place in the documentation. They are illustrative "
"design choices for this sample, not claims about any real service."
msgstr ""
"Konjiniyela abakha ngezindimi zase-Afrika, imibuzo emibili ivela kusenesikhathi: "
"umbhalo wabo uzosebenzisa ama-token amangaki, nokuthi idatha yabo icutshungulwa "
"kuphi. Ngifake i-endpoint yokubala ama-token kanye ne-parameter ye-`region` "
"ukuze le mibuzo ibe nendawo emadokhumentini. Lezi yizinqumo zokuklama "
"ezisetshenziswe njengesibonelo, hhayi izimangalo mayelana ne-service yangempela."

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:29
msgid "What I left out on purpose"
msgstr "Engikushiye ngaphandle ngamabomu"

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:31
msgid ""
"I left out streaming, official SDK packages, billing and pagination. A "
"small set of pages done properly is more useful than a large set done "
"quickly. Streaming would be my next addition, because it changes what a "
"quickstart looks like."
msgstr ""
"Ngishiye ngaphandle i-streaming, ama-package e-SDK asemthethweni, i-billing "
"kanye ne-pagination. Iqoqo elincane lamakhasi enziwe kahle liwusizo kakhulu "
"kunamaqoqo amakhulu enziwe ngokushesha. I-streaming ingaba yinto elandelayo "
"engiyengezayo, ngoba ishintsha indlela i-quickstart ebukeka ngayo."

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:33
msgid "What I would do with a real product"
msgstr "Engingakwenza ngomkhiqizo wangempela"

#: ../../documentation-decisions.md:35
msgid ""
"I would sit with the engineers and read the code before writing a word. I"
" would run every example myself, and I would use support tickets and "
"usage data to decide what to document first. I would also keep a "
"changelog, so developers can see what changed between versions."
msgstr ""
"Ngingahlala nonjiniyela futhi ngifunde i-code ngaphambi kokubhala ngisho "
"negama elilodwa. Ngingasebenzisa zonke izibonelo ngokwami, futhi ngisebenzise "
"ama-support ticket kanye nedatha yokusetshenziswa ukuze nginqume ukuthi "
"yini okufanele ibhalwe kuqala. Ngiphinde ngigcine i-changelog, ukuze "
"onjiniyela babone ukuthi yini eshintshile phakathi kwama-version."